WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.760
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.060
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.340
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.600
And we're best friends.
我们也是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.420
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在我们正为你们带来终极《办公室》重温播客。

6
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:19.400
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会剖析一集《办公室》，并分享只有身临其境的两人才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.560
We're The Office Ladies.
我们是《办公室》女士。

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.020
Hey there.
嘿，大家好。

9
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.600
How's it going today?
今天过得怎么样？

10
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:29.860
Pretty good.
挺好的。

11
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:30.900
I'm pretty cozy.
我觉得很舒服。

12
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.340
I see.
我明白了。

13
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.740
We've both shown up in our robes today.
我们今天都穿着睡袍出现了。

14
00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.040
I am in my pajamas.
我穿着睡衣。

15
00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.040
